    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6c0635d2310d690bda9ed03",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仔细听我说，光明。三冠之中，\n人们总说“菊花赏”是“最强的赛马娘”，\n也就是最有实力的选手才能获胜的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e6cf78731ee495223e0c57b07894d8d0ef041918a1d00d668be3207d1f2980e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
