      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "参加长距离竞赛就像玩一场双六游戏！\n说到双六就会想到骰子！\n而掷骰子一切都靠运气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "151b7c4468951a79109b0a65162cd29bcdb41f038e7fcf250a7e54732f6aecbc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
